@title Cabinet: Table without a plate says why (plate follow)
@area Cabinet
# qa/fixtures/plate-follow-none.novo (built by write_plate_follow_fixtures): cabinet +CP1 with three devices and no mounting plate. Ctrl+T and View, Table used to do nothing; it now says what to do first.
open qa/fixtures/plate-follow-none.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
shot cabinet-no-plate
# With no plate the bar has no Table button: Ctrl+T (also the command field, Cabinet as table, and View, Cabinet, Table) is what a person reaches for.
key ctrl+t
wait 6
expect "The table lists the devices of the mounting plate"
shot table-says-why
check_layout
